OL,3,AEarly morning police raids target
OL,4,Aorganised crime
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have carried out a series of
OL,7,Fearly morning raids targeting those
OL,8,Fsuspected of being involved in
OL,9,Forganised crime.
OL,11,FCleveland Police said 17 people had
OL,12,Fbeen arrested during the operation -
OL,13,Finvolving about 130 officers including
OL,14,Fsome from the National Crime Agency -
OL,15,Facross South Bank, Grangetown and
OL,16,FEston, near Middlesbrough, on Monday.
OL,18,FIt is part of a high-profile response
OL,19,Fto a crash on the nearby A66 last month
OL,20,Fwhich came at the end of a police
OL,21,Fpursuit and left two officers dead.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
